@startuml
title Seat State Diagram

state "FREE" as Free
state "CANDIDATE" as Candidate
state "RESERVED" as Reserved

[*] --> Free

Free --> Candidate : Pending reservation created

Candidate --> Reserved : Reservation confirmed\nPayment successful

Candidate --> Free : Reservation expires
Candidate --> Free : Reservation cancelled

Reserved --> Free : Reservation cancelled

note right of Candidate
SeatStatus.CANDIDATE

The seat is temporarily held
for up to 5 minutes.
end note

note right of Reserved
SeatStatus.RESERVED

The associated reservation
has status RESERVED.
end note

@enduml